  abilityName: Luna Tempest
  abilityDesc: 26 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    7 combo Light attack on single foe (partial HP drain), damage taken fills BB
    gauge for 3 turns, boosts BB Atk for 3 turns, probable evasion for 2 turns &
    boosts own Atk, Def relative to max HP for 3 turns
